# A throw in a play tick: Play.Faulted, the editor alive, the World
# inspectable; Stop returns to Edit with the document unchanged (M10a).
play
wait-ticks 60
inject-throw tick
wait-frames 3
expect-faulted yes
expect-state faulted
expect-entities play 17
wait-frames 10
expect-faulted yes
expect-entities play 17
stop
wait-frames 2
expect-state edit
expect-hash document initial
quit discard
